# Check every text file out with LF on every platform.
#
# The suite reads repository fixtures verbatim — a command template's trailing
# newline is asserted byte-for-byte, and skill frontmatter is parsed — so a
# Windows clone that rewrote those files to CRLF would report a difference the
# product does not have. `eol=lf` overrides the host's `core.autocrlf`, which
# `text=auto` alone would defer to. Binary files are still detected as binary
# and left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
